{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-10_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-10","title":"“這種事”","storyCode":"6-11","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"25014a68b4d94dc7d3f5c43acaa12c633de8699dbf13a2bca79197fd1506d1eb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗚，嗚......\n我肚子好餓！\n爸爸呢？爸爸去哪裡了？\n沒有爸爸不行......我要爸爸！爸爸！\n爸爸會來帶我走的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"兒童？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"通報Blaze-4，Amiya-1小隊，在貧民區四街十號建築的廢墟中發現倖存兒童，感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是龍門人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......是不會傷害你的人。我烏薩斯話說得不好。我沒敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走，這裡很亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔說待在這裡，不可以動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我可以帶你去找爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏在我身後的人，出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......你是羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，退後點。別過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"放下武器，束手就擒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是來幫我們的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島！你知道有什麼東西潛藏在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們好不容易設置好的埋伏......不引誘他們出來，不殺掉他們，我們就會被殺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"拿孩子做埋伏的誘餌，你們不如被殺算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在想什麼？你以為我們被殺就了結了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們被殺，他們也不會放過孩子，他們誰都不會放過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能這麼簡單就結束了，我們甘願被殺也不會把孩子當做誘餌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至沒有攻擊你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"誰會這麼做......你是說穿黑色雨披的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過他們了，你怎麼會不明白！他們是要斬盡殺絕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是藉口。等我制服你們以後，我會為你們申請保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"誰信你？！被你那弩箭射中，人都已經死了，還保護什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時保護你們的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要管了，先把她解決掉，我們重來一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"明明已經聽見集合命令和撤退點了，要是就這樣死在這裡，我們怎麼對得起為了保護孩子而死的他們的父母，他們可是我們的隊友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......孩子，躲遠些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢，你覺得你死了會好點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"煌幹員？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你死了，這些事情也不會從大地上消失的。還是活著比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那些......整合運動呢？那幾個孩子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員灰喉，之前誤解了你，很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動我幹掉了！孩子我藏起來了！你就不能好好聽我說完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要......只要孩子安全就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是不氣別人一兩下就不開心啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你誤解我什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經看到你為了感染者孩子們奮勇作戰的樣子了。嘩，好靚女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你龍門話講得很爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我就觸景生情隨便說的！我以前覺得你是個沒血沒淚的非感染者，加入羅德島說不定是為了刺探情報，我誤解你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是間諜，我就會用這種手段讓你信任我。只要你不是太傻讓我流血致死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你幫我包紮了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我好歹是精英幹員，這是我該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的可能對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但哪怕我知道你是間諜......你做了對的事，這點變不了。如果你是間諜，我會先救你，然後送你進法務處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能會逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別老幻想些有的沒的了。你怎麼跑得過我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"“信任”這個詞，不意味著沒有防範。信任是指，知道你會做什麼事，不會做什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你做的對的，我全力支持；你做的錯的，我要糾正，甚至阻止。這就是信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，灰喉，你信任了我，你用行動糾正了我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的勸說方式真的很爛。他們不是想要負隅頑抗，那是求生的表現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果造成了意外，你還是得進法務處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那隨你的便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還不錯哦！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"她們之間關係，是不是緩和一點了？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大概吧......至少煌這麼嘗試了。也就只有她能這麼快放下成見去就事論事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的精英幹員不只擁有出色的戰鬥能力。煌融入團體、和他人交流的主動性，也是非常專業的。只不過，她也有自己的立場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"想指揮好她，獲取她的支持，就應該取得她的信任，更應該學會怎麼去信任她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我和煌已經共同戰鬥了很長時間，我想......我想博士也可以試試。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我做的還行啊。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"應該......還不太夠吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然表面上大剌剌的，煌的內在其實很複雜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"再經過一些時間、經歷一些事情，Dr.{@nickname}也是可以做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但要再努力一點才行！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"相互信任是困難的，但也是必須的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要博士的力量，而博士想要運用好自己的戰術，就必須先被幹員們認可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個漫長的過程，也是博士必須經歷的過程。"}]},{"label":"那也得她配合才行。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"作為精英幹員裡最擅長攻堅戰的那種，煌並不會在戰術上提供太多思路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她非常需要你的支援，不如說，只要你說，她就會履行你的戰術。這是幹員的專業性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這已經很配合了吧？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員們聽從羅德島一些合理的命令，往往是出於責任感，而不是信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的信任是建立在理解上的，就像煌現在已經開始信任灰喉了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎有整合運動的敵人在接近這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就多給煌創造一點道歉的空間吧，在這種事上，她嘴還蠻笨的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那就給她們多爭取一點時間！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"原來她嘴笨的嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算擅長說話，也不就是擅長表達情感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"其實煌也不是在花時間向灰喉道歉，不如說，她在對抗經驗裡自己對其他人的誤解，甚至是一些根深蒂固的偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"並不只有普通人對感染者有偏見......感染者對普通人也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"內在的敵人和外在的敵人，都是敵人。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們會戰勝所有敵人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那些整合運動的眼神裡充滿了恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和近衛局不可能把人嚇成這樣，別說逼他們不顧一切地打破自己原本的堅持了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們遭遇了什麼樣的敵人……究竟是什麼讓他們變成這個樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......會和那些人為敵嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["？？？","煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
